#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:2
msgid "Cooperative concurrency"
msgstr "Kooperativna konkurentnost"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:4
msgid ""
"Asyncio's scheduling model is *cooperative*, not *preemptive*. The "
"distinction is the single most important mental model the rest of this "
"section builds on, so it is worth pinning down before any code appears."
msgstr ""
"Asyncio-ov model raspoređivanja je *kooperativan*\\ , a ne *preemptivan*\\ ."
" Ta razlika najvažniji je mentalni model na kojem se gradi ostatak ovog "
"odjeljka, pa ju je vrijedno utvrditi prije nego što se pojavi ikakav kod."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:10
msgid "Preemptive vs cooperative"
msgstr "Preemptivno naspram kooperativnog"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:12
msgid ""
"A *preemptive* scheduler -- the kind a desktop operating system uses to keep"
" many programs running at once -- can pause whichever piece of code is "
"currently running at *any* moment and switch to another. The running code "
"does not have to do anything special; the scheduler interrupts it. That "
"makes preemptive scheduling very flexible (no one piece of code can starve "
"the others by being slow), but it also means any shared variable has to be "
"defended carefully, because the switch could land anywhere -- even halfway "
"through writing a value, or partway through reading a list."
msgstr ""
"*Preemptivni* raspoređivač -- vrsta kakvu desktop operativni sustav koristi "
"za istovremeno održavanje mnogih programa u radu -- može zaustaviti onaj dio"
" koda koji se trenutno izvodi u *bilo kojem* trenutku i prebaciti se na "
"drugi. Kod koji se izvodi ne mora učiniti ništa posebno; raspoređivač ga "
"prekida. Time je preemptivno raspoređivanje vrlo fleksibilno (nijedan dio "
"koda ne može izgladnjivati ostale time što je spor), ali to ujedno znači da "
"svaka dijeljena varijabla mora biti pomno zaštićena, jer prebacivanje može "
"pasti bilo gdje -- čak i usred upisivanja vrijednosti ili na pola čitanja "
"liste."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:23
msgid ""
"A *cooperative* scheduler can only switch between pieces of code at points "
"the currently running piece *explicitly hands control back*. On asyncio, "
"those points are every ``await`` and every call to a coroutine that yields "
"internally (most commonly :func:`asyncio.sleep`). Between two awaits, the "
"running coroutine has the CPU to itself."
msgstr ""
"*Kooperativni* raspoređivač može se prebacivati između dijelova koda samo na"
" točkama na kojima dio koji se trenutno izvodi *eksplicitno vraća "
"kontrolu*\\ . U asyncio-u te su točke svaki ``await`` i svaki poziv "
"koroutine koja interno predaje kontrolu (najčešće :func:`asyncio.sleep`\\ )."
" Između dva awaita koroutina koja se izvodi ima CPU samo za sebe."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:30
msgid "Two consequences fall out of that:"
msgstr "Iz toga proizlaze dvije posljedice:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:32
msgid ""
"**A coroutine that never awaits never gets paused.** If a coroutine sits in "
"a tight loop with no ``await`` inside, it monopolises the scheduler and "
"nothing else makes progress. The fix is to ``await asyncio.sleep_ms(0)`` (or"
" some other waiting call) at a sensible point in the loop."
msgstr ""
"**Koroutina koja nikad ne awaita nikad neće biti zaustavljena.** Ako "
"koroutina sjedi u tijesnoj petlji bez ``await`` unutra, monopolizira "
"raspoređivač i ništa drugo ne napreduje. Rješenje je ``await "
"asyncio.sleep_ms(0)`` (ili neki drugi poziv koji čeka) na razumnoj točki u "
"petlji."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Shared state is safe between awaits.** Two coroutines cannot interleave "
"halfway through an operation that has no ``await`` in it. The kind of "
"corruption that arises when preemption lands in the middle of a multi-step "
"update -- one piece of code reading a value while another is partway through"
" changing it -- simply cannot happen here. Coordination between coroutines "
"is still needed when several of them have to share a resource *across* "
"awaits, but the in-the-middle-of-a-line interleaving problem does not apply."
msgstr ""
"**Dijeljeno stanje je sigurno između awaitova.** Dvije koroutine ne mogu se "
"ispreplitati na pola operacije koja u sebi nema ``await``\\ . Vrsta "
"oštećenja koja nastaje kad preempcija padne usred višekoračnog ažuriranja --"
" jedan dio koda čita vrijednost dok je drugi na pola njezine promjene -- "
"jednostavno se ovdje ne može dogoditi. Koordinacija između koroutina i dalje"
" je potrebna kad njih nekoliko mora dijeliti resurs *preko* awaitova, ali "
"problem ispreplitanja usred jednog retka ne vrijedi."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:49
msgid "The three layers"
msgstr "Tri sloja"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:51
msgid ""
"Every asyncio script is built from the same three layers. The next two pages"
" cover them in detail; these are the labels to keep in mind while reading "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Svaka asyncio skripta izgrađena je od istih triju slojeva. Sljedeće dvije "
"stranice obrađuju ih detaljno; ovo su oznake koje treba imati na umu dok ih "
"čitate."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Coroutines** -- functions declared with ``async def``, each one a self-"
"contained unit of work that awaits where appropriate. The Python Overview "
"introduced the ``async``/``await`` keywords; in asyncio they are how a "
"coroutine yields back to the scheduler."
msgstr ""
"**Koroutine** -- funkcije deklarirane s ``async def``\\ , svaka samostalna "
"jedinica rada koja awaita gdje je prikladno. Pregled Pythona uveo je ključne"
" riječi ``async``\\ /\\ ``await``\\ ; u asyncio-u one su način na koji "
"koroutina predaje kontrolu natrag raspoređivaču."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Tasks** -- a wrapper :func:`asyncio.create_task` puts around a coroutine "
"to *schedule it concurrently with the current one*. The application "
"typically creates a handful of tasks for the long-running jobs (the snapshot"
" loop, the network client, the UART reader, ...)."
msgstr ""
"**Zadaci** -- omotač koji :func:`asyncio.create_task` stavlja oko koroutine "
"kako bi je *rasporedio konkurentno s trenutnom*\\ . Aplikacija obično stvara"
" nekolicinu zadataka za dugotrajne poslove (petlju snimaka, mrežnog "
"klijenta, UART čitača, ...)."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:65
msgid ""
"**The event loop** -- the engine underneath that keeps track of which "
"coroutines are waiting and which are ready to run, switching between tasks "
"at every ``await``. The application doesn't write the loop; it hands a top-"
"level coroutine to :func:`asyncio.run` and the loop drives everything from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"**Petlja događaja** -- pogon ispod svega koji prati koje koroutine čekaju, a"
" koje su spremne za izvođenje, prebacujući se između zadataka pri svakom "
"``await``\\ . Aplikacija ne piše petlju; predaje koroutinu najviše razine "
"funkciji :func:`asyncio.run`\\ , a petlja odande pogoni sve."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/cooperative-concurrency.rst:72
msgid ""
"When the application is described that way -- as a small set of coroutines "
"composed by an event loop -- *concurrency becomes a property of the shape of"
" the program*, not something the application has to manage step by step."
msgstr ""
"Kad se aplikacija opiše na taj način -- kao mali skup koroutina sastavljenih"
" putem petlje događaja -- *konkurentnost postaje svojstvo oblika programa*\\"
" , a ne nešto čime aplikacija mora upravljati korak po korak."
